        {
          "text": "UMose wayesethi kuHobabi, indodana kaRehuweli, wakwaMidiyani, umukhwe kaMose: “Sikhuphukela endaweni uJehova asho ngayo ukuthi: ‘Ngiyakuninika yona; hamba nathi, sizokwenzela okuhle; uJehova wakhuluma kahle ngo-Israyeli.",
